
Description:

Disable advertisement and use of URLAUTH extension by default.
Can be enabled with the 'allowurlauth' option.


Config changes:

Added 'allowurlauth' option, defaulting to off.


Upgrade instructions:

Sites that have clients that use/require the URLAUTH extension will have
to enable support for it using the 'allowurlauth' option.
Note that URLAUTH tokens survive mailbox deletion and grant access
to recreated mailbox content.
Also note that support for URLAUTH will be removed from Cyrus v3.14.


GitHub issue:

None.
